            "bible_book_eng": "2 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309552_UKR_TTB_1119_25092017_2 John_1_1_2 John_1_5_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309552_UKR_TTB_1119_25092017_2 John_1_1_2 John_1_5_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0101",
            "teaching_end_point": "0105"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "2 John",
            "book_id": "2 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "3",
            "verse_text": "нехай буде з вами благодать, милість, мир від Бога Отця та Ісуса Христа, Сина Отцевого, у правді та в любові!",
            "paragraph_number": "3",
            "teaching_id": "18836",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/24f50965-e0db-469a-98ac-8c807fd271e9",
            "teaching_name": "2 Івана 1:1-5",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/2john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "2 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "2 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309552_UKR_TTB_1119_25092017_2 John_1_1_2 John_1_5_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309552_UKR_TTB_1119_25092017_2 John_1_1_2 John_1_5_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0101",
            "teaching_end_point": "0105"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "2 John",
            "book_id": "2 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "4",
            "verse_text": "Я дуже зрадів, що між дітьми твоїми знайшов таких, що ходять у правді, як заповідь ми прийняли від Отця.",
            "paragraph_number": "4",
            "teaching_id": "18836",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/24f50965-e0db-469a-98ac-8c807fd271e9",
            "teaching_name": "2 Івана 1:1-5",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/2john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "2 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "2 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309552_UKR_TTB_1119_25092017_2 John_1_1_2 John_1_5_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309552_UKR_TTB_1119_25092017_2 John_1_1_2 John_1_5_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0101",
            "teaching_end_point": "0105"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "2 John",
            "book_id": "2 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "5",
            "verse_text": "І тепер я благаю тебе, пані, не так, ніби пишу тобі нову заповідь, але ту, яку маємо від початку, щоб ми любили один одного!",
            "paragraph_number": "5",
            "teaching_id": "18836",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/24f50965-e0db-469a-98ac-8c807fd271e9",
            "teaching_name": "2 Івана 1:1-5",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/2john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "2 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "2 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309552_UKR_TTB_1119_25092017_2 John_1_1_2 John_1_5_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309552_UKR_TTB_1119_25092017_2 John_1_1_2 John_1_5_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0101",
            "teaching_end_point": "0105"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "2 John",
            "book_id": "2 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "6",
            "verse_text": "А любов ця щоб ми жили згідно з Його заповідями. Це та заповідь, яку ви чули від початку, щоб ви згідно з нею жили.",
            "paragraph_number": "6",
            "teaching_id": "18837",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/e42a8ad4-dd22-4430-b9ea-39f8514245aa",
            "teaching_name": "2 Івана 1:6-7",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/2john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "2 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "2 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309553_UKR_TTB_1120_26092017_2 John_1_6_2 John_1_7_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309553_UKR_TTB_1120_26092017_2 John_1_6_2 John_1_7_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0106",
            "teaching_end_point": "0107"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "2 John",
            "book_id": "2 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "7",
            "verse_text": "Бо в світ увійшло багато обманців, які не визнають Ісуса Христа, що прийшов був у тілі. Такий то обманець та антихрист!",
            "paragraph_number": "7",
            "teaching_id": "18837",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/e42a8ad4-dd22-4430-b9ea-39f8514245aa",
            "teaching_name": "2 Івана 1:6-7",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/2john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "2 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "2 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309553_UKR_TTB_1120_26092017_2 John_1_6_2 John_1_7_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309553_UKR_TTB_1120_26092017_2 John_1_6_2 John_1_7_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0106",
            "teaching_end_point": "0107"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "2 John",
            "book_id": "2 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "8",
            "verse_text": "Пильнуйте себе, щоб ви не згубили того, над чим працювали, але щоб прийняли повну нагороду.",
            "paragraph_number": "8",
            "teaching_id": "18838",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/9e500f6a-99e7-4f4b-a521-e7da12ec34ae",
            "teaching_name": "2 Івана 1:8-13",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/2john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "2 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "2 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309554_UKR_TTB_1121_27092017_2 John_1_8_2 John_1_13_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309554_UKR_TTB_1121_27092017_2 John_1_8_2 John_1_13_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0108",
            "teaching_end_point": "0113"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "2 John",
            "book_id": "2 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "9",
            "verse_text": "Кожен, хто робить переступ та не пробуває в науці Христовій, той Бога не має. А хто пробуває в науці Його, той має і Отця, і Сина.",
            "paragraph_number": "9",
            "teaching_id": "18838",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/9e500f6a-99e7-4f4b-a521-e7da12ec34ae",
            "teaching_name": "2 Івана 1:8-13",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/2john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "2 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "2 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309554_UKR_TTB_1121_27092017_2 John_1_8_2 John_1_13_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309554_UKR_TTB_1121_27092017_2 John_1_8_2 John_1_13_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0108",
            "teaching_end_point": "0113"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "2 John",
            "book_id": "2 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "10",
            "verse_text": "Коли хто приходить до вас, але не приносить науки цієї, не приймайте до дому його, і не вітайте його!",
            "paragraph_number": "10",
            "teaching_id": "18838",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/9e500f6a-99e7-4f4b-a521-e7da12ec34ae",
            "teaching_name": "2 Івана 1:8-13",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/2john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "2 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "2 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309554_UKR_TTB_1121_27092017_2 John_1_8_2 John_1_13_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309554_UKR_TTB_1121_27092017_2 John_1_8_2 John_1_13_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0108",
            "teaching_end_point": "0113"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "2 John",
            "book_id": "2 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "11",
            "verse_text": "Хто бо вітає його, той участь бере в лихих учинках його.",
            "paragraph_number": "11",
            "teaching_id": "18838",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/9e500f6a-99e7-4f4b-a521-e7da12ec34ae",
            "teaching_name": "2 Івана 1:8-13",
            "teachings_badge_image": "https://manage.churchbase.com/uploads/ttb_bible_badges/2john.jpg",
            "bible_book": "2 Івана",
            "bible_book_eng": "2 John",
            "teaching_file_name": "309554_UKR_TTB_1121_27092017_2 John_1_8_2 John_1_13_MM_.mp3",
            "folder_path": "https://ttb-content-migrations-gigster.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/TAM_TTB-Tamil+BI/309554_UKR_TTB_1121_27092017_2 John_1_8_2 John_1_13_MM_.mp3",
            "teaching_start_point": "0108",
            "teaching_end_point": "0113"
          },
          {
            "book_name": "2 John",
            "book_id": "2 John",
            "book_order": "",
            "chapter_id": "1",
            "chapter_title": "Chapter 1",
            "verse_id": "12",
            "verse_text": "Багато я мав написати до вас, але не схотів на папері й чорнилом. Та маю надію прибути до вас, і говорити устами до уст, щоб повна була ваша радість!",
            "paragraph_number": "12",
            "teaching_id": "18838",
            "teaching_audio": "https://ttb-transcoder-final-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/9e500f6a-99e7-4f4b-a521-e7da12ec34ae",
            "teaching_name": "2 Івана 1:8-13",
